@startuml seq-account-deployment
actor Person
participant App
actor "Payer" as Payer
participant "Wallet Core" as WC
participant "EVM network\n(USDC, EntryPoint, Factory)" as EVM
participant "Stellar" as XLM

== 1. Creating the account: nothing is deployed ==
Person -> App : Create account
App -> EVM : factory.getAddress(owners): read-only, no gas
App --> Person : their address (and their Stellar address, derived from it)

== 2. Receiving money: still not deployed ==
Payer -> EVM : USDC transfer to the address
note over EVM
  The balance sits in the USDC contract under that address.
  The account still has no code: receiving needs no signature.
end note
Payer -> XLM : USDC or XLM to the Stellar address
note over XLM
  The same on Stellar: the balance lives in the asset contract.
end note

== 3. First time spending on an EVM network: it deploys ==
Person -> App : send, pay, save...
App -> WC : operation with initCode (factory + owners)
WC -> EVM : handleOps (sponsored gas)
EVM -> EVM : the factory creates the account (CREATE2, same address)\nand runs the operation in the same transaction

== 4. First time spending on Stellar: it deploys ==
App -> WC : deploy the smart account
WC -> XLM : the sponsor account deploys it\nfrom OpenZeppelin's WASM
App -> WC : signed call (see sponsorship)
@enduml
